    2 O      -3.793   -4.896   -0.689   -4.139   -4.386   -0.525   -3.849   -5.154   -1.003   -0.314
    3 Si     -8.999   -2.855    2.146   -9.036   -3.122    1.843   -8.994   -2.548    2.458    0.312
